# Which backends are safe automatic-rollback targets. Read by deploy/portainer-deploy.sh, ci-cd.yml and the tests.
# Values are commit SHAs, nothing secret.
#
# First main-line commit with BOTH session revocation ("sv", 7311725) and atomic password reset/change (85e0b37).
# Only this commit and its descendants are safe; older backends revive revoked tokens or allow reset races.
ROLLBACK_SAFE_SINCE=85e0b377034199ab6981c10cd39b41d986965151
# Rollback build: branch rollback/1b885e9-sv (1b885e9 plus both protections). Keep this line, and the published
# digest-pinned image, until a production release at or after ROLLBACK_SAFE_SINCE has been verified healthy with
# the checks in docs/operations.md. Running such a commit alone is not enough.
ROLLBACK_COMPAT_SHA=8055fa4ae3cd0cc11cb391ac0c43f979308ead78
